## Version
Viem v2.44.4 (from `packages/utils/package.json`)

## Core Principles
Use `getAddress` for address validation, never cast as Address type, use `@repo/utils/web3` for chain utilities (`ChainType`, `getChainType`, `getChainMetadata`)

## Address Handling
`getAddress(rawAddress)` in try/catch, throw on invalid Ethereum address

## Transaction Handling
Send transaction: `walletClient.sendTransaction({ to: getAddress(to), value: parseEther(value), data })`, catch `INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS`

## Performance
Use multicall for batch requests, WebSocket for real-time updates

